&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In March/April 2024, I also hold a 10-hour doctoral course on &lt;em&gt;Reinforcement
Learning for Run-time Performance Management&lt;/em&gt;. &lt;a href="https://grussorusso.github.io/slides/RL-Roma2.pdf"&gt;Slides
(partial)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check my &lt;a href="https://grussorusso.github.io/cv.pdf"&gt;CV&lt;/a&gt; for
